      "evidence_text": "The cops were already on our tail. Hey police! Alright, we're on our way over and out. Okay, meet me at the market. What about these straw bales right here? That looks a little suspicious. Where we at baby? Mr. Beast! They're so close. I can hear them. I can hear them. This is something. We're on somebody. Show us your hands! Show us your hands! What are we going? What? What's your name? Is this Darius? Let me go! Let me go! Let me go! Yeah, it's only been 10 minutes. And Darius has already been arrested. I see so many cops go! They're forming a line and sweeping the city. I'm officially at the market. Tariq, we're heading your way. Alright, I'll be ready. Alright, Tariq. Hand me the map. They clearly formed a straight line and are going and checking every nook and crack. The only weakness in that strategy though is if we can somehow sneak past the line, they're not gonna suspect us to be in buildings they already searched. If there was ever a time to penetrate the line, I've got a plan to follow. I don't think the cops realize there's tunnels under the city.",
